Output ../src/assets/recordings/tui-connect.webp

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "mcp-tui --cmd npx --args '@modelcontextprotocol/server-everything,stdio'"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Tab
Sleep 800ms
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Up
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 1s
